# 🛠️ DevToolbox

A unified CLI suite of utilities to supercharge your developer workflow!

## Installation

Make sure you have Python 3 installed.

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Tools

### 1. `hop` (Git Hop)
Safely navigate between git branches without losing uncommitted work. 
```bash
python cli.py hop feature-branch # Automatically stashes changes and hops
python cli.py hop -              # Hops back to previous branch and pops stash
```

### 2. `replay` (API Replay)
Intercepts failing API requests and lets you replay them instantly in your terminal.
```bash
python cli.py start-daemon  # Starts the localhost:9999 daemon
python cli.py replay        # Read the last failing request payload and natively re-executes the cURL
```
